{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13497","headline":"玄元皇帝应见贺圣祚无疆 · 李岑","name":"玄元皇帝应见贺圣祚无疆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇纲归有道，帝系祖玄元。\n运表南山祚，神通北极尊。\n大同齐日月，兴废应乾坤。\n圣后趋庭礼，宗臣稽首言。\n千官欣肆观，万国贺深恩。\n锡宴云天接，飞声雷地喧。\n祥光浮紫阁，喜气绕皇轩。\n未预承天命，空勤望帝门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}